Sonic is back with a bold New Direction  in Sonic Frontiers Sonic Frontiers takes  cues from Modern open world games to  create something both familiar and all  new for Sonic so here is everything you  need to know about Sonic Frontiers  [Music]  Sonic Frontiers is being directed by  morio Kishimoto of Sonic team and the  same director behind 2017 Sonic forces  while Sonic forces garnered relatively  negative to average reviews with a meta  score rating of 57 and a 6.5 from users  it seems Kishimoto really took the  criticisms of the game to Heart in an  interview with Game Informer he revealed  that in 2022 he'd been on Sonic team for  19 years and that he intended to learn  from both the successes and failures of  every Sonic game from Sonic forces in  particular he noted that shorter stages  pulling back on Sonic's speed a little  and implementing new actions wasn't  satisfying fans producer Takashi izuka  stated he wants Frontiers to feel like a  bold New Direction for Sonic and a  template for future Sonic games similar  to how Sonic Adventure had set the  template for future 3D Sonic games while  it looks and feels similar to breath of  the wild with the inspiration seeming to  be fairly apparent current Kishimoto  refers to Sonic Frontiers not as an open  world game but rather an open zone game  after summer game Fest 2022 it was  revealed the game has a larger open Zone  Hub with cyberspace areas within  containing traditional Sonic stages  [Music]  as I mentioned there are essentially two  different parts to the gameplay the open  Zone which is what first got attention  for being such a new departure for the  Sonic formula and the cyberspace zones  open zone areas include multiple puzzles  you'll need to solve along with  platforming side quests and The Game's  new combat system bosses also exist in  the open zones for Sonic to battle each  zone is absolutely massive and meant to  allow the player to explore as they want  and play in the style they want brand  new to Sonic with Sonic Frontiers is a  skill tree Fallen enemies now drop skill  pieces Sonic can collect and used to  upgrade his skills not only that but  Sonic will be able to upgrade his stats  by collecting red seeds of power and  blue seeds of Defense these seeds can be  found by completing puzzles and side  quests in the open zones these puzzles  can also unlock new areas of the map  combat is another new feature to Sonic  Frontiers while Sonic will maintain his  classic skill of a harming attack he'll  also have a drop Dash and stop attack be  able to slide at any point and boost his  speed on on ground or mid-air not only  that the Sonic can now attack with his  fists in melee combat perform Combos and  use the brand new skill tree to level up  these skills sciloop is another new  ability that from my experience playing  at summer game Fest 2022 unlocks early  on siloop sees you run in a circle  around an enemy while activating this  ability in order to break enemies  Shields and guards then have an opening  to get in attacks sileup can also be  used to quickly collect Rings after  getting hit by an enemy Sonic can also  now both Parry enemy attacks and Dodge  parrying allows Sonic to use this window  to counter attack meanwhile dodging at  the right time briefly slows down time  allowing Sonic to get in more attacks  included in Sonic's new skill set is a  meter that will fill up during Combos  and when high enough allows Sonic to  perform a phantom Rush which boosts  Sonic's attack power until the meter  drops back to zero another new attack is  Sonic Boom  sadly not the song Sonic Boom from the  Sonic CD but rather a brand new ranged  attack that shoots out shock waves while  Rush is an attack that sends Sonic's  zigzagging to avoid attacks and crash  into the enemy while there are basic  enemies Sonic will be up against there's  also much larger boss-like enemies  called Guardians many of these have  unique ways to be defeated and utilize  Sonic's platforming similar in a way to  say Shadow of the Colossus one such  Guardian might see Sonic running up his  giant tendrils to attack its top while  another might Force Sonic to grind along  giant rings encircling its insides in  order to open up a weak point for  defeating bosses Sonic will obtain  portal gears portal gears allow Sonic to  unlock the other half of the game the  cyberspace stages these are classic  Sonic stages and each one contains  numerous challenges for you to complete  by doing so Sonic will be able to obtain  Vault Keys which can in turn be used to  unlock chaos Emerald's vaults it would  be a Sonic game without Super Sonic and  in Sonic frontier's Tokyo game show  trailer it was revealed that Sonic could  once again collect chaos emeralds and  eventually utilize these to turn into  supersonic Frontiers also features a  couple different modes in order to  increase accessibility players can  choose between at least two different  modes action and high speed mode which  Alters how Sonic feels and controls  additionally there's a mode that allows  players to turn on auto combos where  tapping a single button will make Sonic  perform as various combos against  enemies  [Music]  Angel Island is the home to the Master  Emerald and watched over by Knuckles who  is chosen for this solitary Duty as it  turns out thousands of years prior his  Echidna ancestors had tried to steal the  power of the Master Emerald so he feels  watching over the emerald could be an  atonement for his ancestors sins  Knuckles makes it his quest to explore  Angel Island for every and any possible  vulnerability to the chaos emeralds and  discover the origin of the master  Emerald's Powers who built this Shrine  to the emeralds  [Music]  go  in doing so he finds a mysterious Cog  and Shrine after placing the Cog he's  warped the way to a desolate Island  filled with mysterious metallic beings  and a strange character with the power  to lock him away in a prison according  to the overview trailer Sonic has left  for the Starfall Islands to collect the  chaos emeralds with Amy and Tails when  they're sucked into a dimensional portal  where Sonic is separated from his  friends Landing in cyberspace he's able  to escape to Kronos Island and discovers  tails and Amy's seem to have been  captured by the same Force as knuckles  he encounters the mysterious figure who  locked away Knuckles who seems to think  they're protecting the world asking  Sonic to submit and leave immediately it  seems this character may also be in  charge of the massive Guardians and  likely has something to do with the  secret of the Ancients which is likely  the power behind the Chaos Emeralds  Sonic Frontiers releases on November 8th  for Nintendo switch PS5 PS4 Xbox series  X slash S Xbox One and steam for sixty  dollars you can pick up the standard  edition while 70 will get you the  digital deluxe edition for pre-ordering  either one you'll get an adventurous  treasure box which includes skill points  Red Seas of power and blue Seas of power  so seemingly a head start to your stats  the digital deluxe edition exclusively  comes with the Explorer's treasure box  which contains Amy's memory tokens a  portal gear cast Emerald Vault keys and  additional gloves and shoes for Sonic  not only that but you'll also get a  digital art book and 25 track digital  mini soundtrack and that wraps up  everything you need to know about Sonic  Frontiers are you looking forward to the  game and out of curiosity what was the  last 3D Sonic game you played let us  know in the comments below and I'll see  you next time  foreign
 

